# arcus-arb Phase A environment / Phase A 环境变量
#
# No environment variables or secrets are required for record-only:
#
#   python3 main.py --symbol SNDK --hedge lighter-rh --record-only
#
# Phase B0 only, after an explicit --tiny-live --confirm-mainnet preflight:
ARCUS_ACCOUNT_ADDRESS=
ARCUS_ACCOUNT_INDEX=
ARCUS_API_KEY=
ARCUS_PRIVATE_KEY=
LIGHTER_ACCOUNT_INDEX=

# The mature Lighter adapter also requires these values for B0:
# LIGHTER_API_KEY_INDEX=
# LIGHTER_API_PRIVATE_KEY=

# Legacy Arcus private-key fallbacks, used only when ARCUS_PRIVATE_KEY and the
# other direct-value source are absent. ARCUS_PRIVATE_KEY is the key value,
# not a filename. Never commit any credential or key material.
# ARCUS_ED25519_PRIVATE_KEY=
# ARCUS_ED25519_PRIVATE_KEY_FILE=/secure/local/path/arcus-ed25519.key
#
# B0 never generates a wallet, registers an API key, or prints private key
# material. Keep the real .env ignored by Git.
# After creating the real file, restrict it to the owner on macOS/Linux:
# chmod 600 .env
# 建立真正的 .env 后，请在 macOS/Linux 限制为只有档案拥有者可读写：
# chmod 600 .env
